        "filing_date": "2026-07-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, there can be no assurance that we will be able to compete successfully, that our products will achieve market acceptance, or that our current or future competitors will not develop products or technologies that are more effective, easier to use, less expensive, more widely adopted or approved more quickly than ours.",
        "start_character": 28039,
